title: Start
---

You encounter a [italic]mysterious[/italic] man, standing at the edge of a calm tide.

Mysterious Man: The sun sets, as it does every day; but I can't help but feel that this evening is different.

Mysterious Man: Don't you feel the same way?

He smiles gently at you. His demeanor gives you no reason to feel apprehensive, and yet you do.

Mysterious Man: Is there something wrong?

-> Lie to him
    You: Hello there! It's good to see a friendly face.
-> Speak your mind
    You: youre freakig me out bro stop talking to me like that
    Mysterious Man: [italic]3 sobbing emojis[/italic]
